1abba3aad53b676954b9007 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "とうのさん、こんばんは！\n前回のスケブイラストはとても素敵です、とうのさんのスタイルで二人共はとても可愛くてイケメン。。。ずっと壁紙にしました！毎日見ると元気に出ています。衣装のデザインも格好よくて素晴らしいし、とうのさんが描いた代わりの表情も大好きです！また、ありあがとうございました！\n\nもしよければ、今回はこのキャラクターをリクエストしたいです： https://toyhou.se/15.jaynalu/gallery#61831571\n\n青いケモノ犬です、ちょっとシャイだけど人懐っこくて元気な子です。髪と尻尾に羽があります。星と夜空をモチーフにしています。\n\nトウノさんの衣装デザインもまたお任せしたいです！星をテーマにしたおしゃれなストリート系をお願いしたい、その他の詳細については、お任せします！\n\nポーズも表情も自由に選べる！よろしくおねがいします！🙏\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/15.jaynalu/gallery#61831571", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tou_no25/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c51181ea/uploads/origins/b4492247-c1a3-40dd-b3a3-8c56105ef49c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d60b203f0859ec4ab75a94107b77e6d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c51181ea/uploads/origins/b4492247-c1a3-40dd-b3a3-8c56105ef49c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d60b203f0859ec4ab75a94107b77e6d9, https://si.imgix.net/c51181ea/uploads/origins/b4492247-c1a3-40dd-b3a3-8c56105ef49c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3e2dfb92aafbc816c2e96ecc557ed51 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c51181ea/uploads/origins/b4492247-c1a3-40dd-b3a3-8c56105ef49c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23f3576289cb817256137892d7bf026c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I love your art style. I would like to request a commission for my OC. Feel free to draw anything you want. as for any poses for the commission, I don't have any idea and I would like to leave it up to you if that is okay.\nI want my OC to wear nice clothes. any style is fine.Thanks!\nHere is my OC : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PKasAHzTv4DGjXs3Ner8kmDH_qGC1kAg?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tou_no25/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5c4989c4/uploads/origins/65193dbd-fa56-47ad-a079-06c49451679d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5165e077e0c5757736a77d665f22a67c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5c4989c4/uploads/origins/65193dbd-fa56-47ad-a079-06c49451679d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5165e077e0c5757736a77d665f22a67c, https://si.imgix.net/5c4989c4/uploads/origins/65193dbd-fa56-47ad-a079-06c49451679d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa81b3f30da53617aff18b269cbb2f82 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5c4989c4/uploads/origins/65193dbd-fa56-47ad-a079-06c49451679d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b97502f6aa42a4a95b34be9d8bb52c48 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, sensai! It's great to see that you've started accepting requests again, so I want to commission you this time. This is my character's reference: https://1drv.ms/f/s!Arj3UtK2ZY5qiEOXfxOuoNc2QDIV?e=FfYGkL I hope you can draw him with cute pose.And he is a three-tail fox boy.Any background is as you like. And still love your artworks, thanks for the chance.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tou_no25/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33322296/uploads/origins/140853b9-2471-408b-a1ae-b1f5f74127d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=edc13cda4a418a58b15bcf59b8ff6fa8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/33322296/uploads/origins/140853b9-2471-408b-a1ae-b1f5f74127d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=edc13cda4a418a58b15bcf59b8ff6fa8, https://si.imgix.net/33322296/uploads/origins/140853b9-2471-408b-a1ae-b1f5f74127d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtsha